01:22:30,000 --> 01:22:36,000
The Missing is a 2003 American Western film directed by Ron Howard
and starring Tommy Lee Jones and Cate Blanchett.

12
01:30:00,000 --> 01:30:06,000
It is based on Thomas Eidson's 1995 novel The Last Ride.

13
01:37:30,000 --> 01:37:36,000
Set in 1885 New Mexico Territory, the film is notable for the authentic use of the Apache
language by various actors, some of whom spent long hours studying it.

14
01:45:00,000 --> 01:45:06,000
It was produced by Revolution Studios, Imagine Entertainment, and Daniel Ostroff
Productions and distributed by Columbia Pictures (Sony Pictures Releasing).

